---
// Technical Arsenal Matrix Component — Swiss Division 03
---

<section id="arsenal" class="space-y-8 scroll-mt-24 pt-8">
  <!-- Section Heading — Swiss Division 03 -->
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between border-b border-theme-border pb-3 gap-3">
    <div>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-theme-accent font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase block">
        // COMPETENCIES &amp; STACK :: DIVISION 03
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary mt-1">Technical Arsenal Matrix</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-theme-muted">
      STACK_AUDIT: HIGH-CONCURRENCY DETERMINISTIC CORE
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4-Column Architectural Blueprint Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
    <!-- Pillar 1: Fast Backends & APIs -->
    <div class="p-5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border bg-theme-surface space-y-4 hover:border-theme-accent transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-theme-muted mb-1">[PILLAR_01]</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-theme-primary mb-1">Fast Backends &amp; APIs</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted font-sans mb-3">
          Your apps never freeze or crash, even during massive user traffic spikes.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary">
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Rust (Axum &amp; Tokio)</span>
            <span class="text-theme-secondary font-bold bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-[11px]">Super-Fast</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Java 21 (Spring Boot 3.4)</span>
            <span class="text-theme-accent font-semibold bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-[11px]">Enterprise</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Real-Time WebSockets</span>
            <span class="text-theme-muted bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Sub-10ms</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Multi-Threaded Daemons</span>
            <span class="text-theme-primary bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Parallel</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>High-Load Concurrency</span>
            <span class="text-theme-muted bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">10k+ RPS</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-theme-border font-mono text-[11px] text-theme-accent">
        <span class="font-bold">WHY IT MATTERS:</span> Sub-millisecond execution without bloated cloud costs.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 2: Secure Databases & Data -->
    <div class="p-5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border bg-theme-surface space-y-4 hover:border-theme-accent transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-theme-muted mb-1">[PILLAR_02]</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-theme-primary mb-1">Secure Databases</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted font-sans mb-3">
          Your business records are safely protected against data leaks and financial math errors.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary">
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>PostgreSQL 16 &amp; SeaORM</span>
            <span class="text-theme-secondary font-bold bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-[11px]">ACID Safe</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Spring Data JPA / Hibernate</span>
            <span class="text-theme-accent font-semibold bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-[11px]">Robust</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Redis Caching &amp; Pub/Sub</span>
            <span class="text-theme-muted bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">In-Memory</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>SQLite Embedded Storage</span>
            <span class="text-theme-muted bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Local Edge</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>Connection Pool Tuning</span>
            <span class="text-theme-primary bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Zero Leak</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-theme-border font-mono text-[11px] text-theme-accent">
        <span class="font-bold">WHY IT MATTERS:</span> 100% data integrity with zero downtime during peak ledger operations.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 3: Smart Hardware & Devices -->
    <div class="p-5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border bg-theme-surface space-y-4 hover:border-theme-accent transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-theme-muted mb-1">[PILLAR_03]</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-theme-primary mb-1">Smart Hardware &amp; IoT</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted font-sans mb-3">
          Connects physical gates, attendance machines, and security cameras seamlessly.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary">
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>ZKTeco Biometrics (ADMS)</span>
            <span class="text-theme-secondary font-bold bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-[11px]">Push API</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>AI Cameras &amp; Video (RTSP)</span>
            <span class="text-theme-accent font-semibold bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-[11px]">Vision AI</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Barrier Gate Relays</span>
            <span class="text-theme-muted bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Hardware</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>RS485 / Serial Modbus</span>
            <span class="text-theme-primary bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Direct Bus</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>Barcode &amp; POS Systems</span>
            <span class="text-theme-muted bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Multi-Term</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-theme-border font-mono text-[11px] text-theme-accent">
        <span class="font-bold">WHY IT MATTERS:</span> Bridges physical electrical relays directly with web servers in real time.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 4: Modern Web & Cross-Platform Apps -->
    <div class="p-5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border bg-theme-surface space-y-4 hover:border-theme-accent transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-theme-muted mb-1">[PILLAR_04]</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-theme-primary mb-1">Web &amp; Cross-Platform</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted font-sans mb-3">
          Clean, fast interfaces your team and customers can use without technical training.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-theme-secondary">
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>React 19 &amp; TypeScript</span>
            <span class="text-theme-secondary font-bold bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-[11px]">Modern</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Astro &amp; Tailwind CSS</span>
            <span class="text-theme-accent font-semibold bg-theme-lowest border border-theme-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm text-[11px]">100/100 Perf</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Flutter (iOS &amp; Android)</span>
            <span class="text-theme-primary bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Cross-Plat</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-theme-border/60">
            <span>Interactive 3D (Three.js)</span>
            <span class="text-theme-muted bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">WebGL</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>Linux VPS &amp; Docker</span>
            <span class="text-theme-muted bg-theme-lowest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm border border-theme-border text-[11px]">Deploy</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-theme-border font-mono text-[11px] text-theme-accent">
        <span class="font-bold">WHY IT MATTERS:</span> Single-click deployment with zero bloat and instant responsive UI.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
